### Backend API Tests for Modtra
### Base URL
@baseURL = http://localhost:4000
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### ============================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION
### ============================================

### Register new user
POST {{baseURL}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "Test User"
}

### Login (copy the token from response)
POST {{baseURL}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Get current user profile (requires auth)
GET {{baseURL}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 2. SEARCH APIs (NEW)
### ============================================

### Get trending products
GET {{baseURL}}/api/search/trending?limit=5

### Get bestsellers
GET {{baseURL}}/api/search/bestsellers?limit=10

### Get new arrivals
GET {{baseURL}}/api/search/new-arrivals?limit=10

### Get top rated products
GET {{baseURL}}/api/search/top-rated?limit=10

### Advanced search with filters
GET {{baseURL}}/api/search/advanced?q=trà&category=coffee&minPrice=30000&maxPrice=80000&sortBy=price_asc&limit=20

### ============================================
### 3. WISHLIST APIs (NEW - requires auth)
### ============================================

### Get user's wishlist
GET {{baseURL}}/api/wishlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add product to wishlist
POST {{baseURL}}/api/wishlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "YOUR_PRODUCT_ID_HERE"
}

### Remove from wishlist
DELETE {{baseURL}}/api/wishlist/YOUR_PRODUCT_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Check if product is in wishlist
GET {{baseURL}}/api/wishlist/check/YOUR_PRODUCT_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get wishlist item count
GET {{baseURL}}/api/wishlist/count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bulk check multiple products
POST {{baseURL}}/api/wishlist/check-bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productIds": ["product-id-1", "product-id-2", "product-id-3"]
}

### ============================================
### 4. REVIEWS APIs (EXTENDED)
### ============================================

### Get reviews for a product
GET {{baseURL}}/api/reviews?productId=YOUR_PRODUCT_ID&limit=10&offset=0

### Create a review (requires auth)
POST {{baseURL}}/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "YOUR_PRODUCT_ID",
  "rating": 5,
  "title": "Amazing matcha!",
  "content": "Best matcha latte I've ever had. Smooth and creamy with perfect sweetness level."
}

### Update review (requires auth - owner only)
PUT {{baseURL}}/api/reviews/REVIEW_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 4,
  "title": "Updated: Still great!",
  "content": "Updated my review after trying different variations."
}

### Delete review (requires auth - owner only)
DELETE {{baseURL}}/api/reviews/REVIEW_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 5. ADMIN APIs (NEW - requires auth)
### ============================================

### Get admin dashboard stats
GET {{baseURL}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get all orders (admin)
GET {{baseURL}}/api/admin/orders?status=pending&limit=20

### Get order detail (admin)
GET {{baseURL}}/api/admin/orders/ORDER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update order status (admin)
PATCH {{baseURL}}/api/admin/orders/ORDER_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "confirmed"
}

### Create new product (admin)
POST {{baseURL}}/api/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "matcha-latte-special",
  "name": "Matcha Latte Đặc Biệt",
  "nameEn": "Special Matcha Latte",
  "category": "matcha",
  "price": 65000,
  "image": "/images/products/matcha-latte-special.jpg",
  "description": "Matcha cao cấp từ Nhật Bản",
  "descriptionEn": "Premium Japanese matcha",
  "tags": ["matcha", "hot", "premium"],
  "isNew": true,
  "isBestseller": false,
  "inStock": true,
  "ingredients": ["Matcha Nhật Bản", "Sữa tươi", "Đường"],
  "customIce": true,
  "customSugar": true,
  "customMilk": ["Sữa tươi", "Sữa yến mạch", "Sữa hạnh nhân"],
  "customSize": ["M", "L"]
}

### Update product (admin)
PUT {{baseURL}}/api/admin/products/PRODUCT_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 70000,
  "inStock": true
}

### Delete product (admin)
DELETE {{baseURL}}/api/admin/products/PRODUCT_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get all users (admin)
GET {{baseURL}}/api/admin/users?limit=50

### Get all coupons (admin)
GET {{baseURL}}/api/admin/coupons

### Create coupon (admin)
POST {{baseURL}}/api/admin/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SPRING2026",
  "discountPercent": 15,
  "minOrderValue": 100000,
  "maxUses": 100,
  "expiresAt": "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"
}

### Update coupon (admin)
PUT {{baseURL}}/api/admin/coupons/COUPON_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "discountPercent": 20,
  "isActive": true
}

### Delete coupon (admin)
DELETE {{baseURL}}/api/admin/coupons/COUPON_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get analytics (admin)
GET {{baseURL}}/api/admin/analytics?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 6. PAYMENTS APIs (NEW - mock)
### ============================================

### Initiate payment
POST {{baseURL}}/api/payments/initiate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORDER_ID",
  "amount": 150000,
  "method": "momo"
}

### Verify payment
POST {{baseURL}}/api/payments/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "TRANSACTION_ID",
  "orderId": "ORDER_ID"
}

### Payment webhook (called by payment provider)
POST {{baseURL}}/api/payments/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "mock-txn-123",
  "orderId": "order-456",
  "status": "success",
  "amount": 150000
}

### ============================================
### 7. SHIPPING APIs (NEW)
### ============================================

### Get shipping methods
GET {{baseURL}}/api/shipping/methods

### Calculate shipping fee
POST {{baseURL}}/api/shipping/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "district": "Quận 1",
  "city": "Hồ Chí Minh",
  "weight": 500
}

### Track shipment
GET {{baseURL}}/api/shipping/track/TRACKING_CODE

### ============================================
### 8. NOTIFICATIONS APIs (NEW - requires auth)
### ============================================

### Get user notifications
GET {{baseURL}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark notification as read
PUT {{baseURL}}/api/notifications/NOTIFICATION_ID/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Subscribe to push notifications
POST {{baseURL}}/api/notifications/subscribe
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/...",
  "keys": {
    "p256dh": "key",
    "auth": "auth"
  }
}

### ============================================
### 9. SUPPORT APIs (NEW)
### ============================================

### Get help articles
GET {{baseURL}}/api/support/help?category=order

### Create support ticket (requires auth)
POST {{baseURL}}/api/support/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Order delivery issue",
  "message": "My order hasn't arrived after 3 days",
  "category": "delivery"
}

### Get user's tickets
GET {{baseURL}}/api/support/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 10. ANALYTICS APIs (NEW)
### ============================================

### Track event
POST {{baseURL}}/api/analytics/track
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "product_view",
  "productId": "PRODUCT_ID",
  "sessionId": "session-123"
}

### ============================================
### 11. EXISTING APIs (for reference)
### ============================================

### Get all products with filters
GET {{baseURL}}/api/products?category=matcha&minPrice=0&maxPrice=100000&sortBy=price_asc&limit=20&offset=0

### Get single product
GET {{baseURL}}/api/products/matcha-latte-kem-sua

### Get related products
GET {{baseURL}}/api/products/related/matcha-latte-kem-sua

### Autocomplete search
GET {{baseURL}}/api/products/autocomplete?q=tra

### Get all categories
GET {{baseURL}}/api/categories

### Get all locations
GET {{baseURL}}/api/locations

### Get active coupons
GET {{baseURL}}/api/coupons

### Validate coupon
POST {{baseURL}}/api/coupons/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "WELCOME10",
  "orderTotal": 150000
}

### Create order (requires auth)
POST {{baseURL}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "PRODUCT_ID",
      "quantity": 2,
      "ice": "normal",
      "sugar": "50%",
      "milk": "Sữa tươi"
    }
  ],
  "deliveryMethod": "delivery",
  "shippingAddress": "123 Nguyễn Huệ, Quận 1",
  "district": "Quận 1",
  "city": "Hồ Chí Minh",
  "phone": "0901234567",
  "couponCode": "WELCOME10"
}

### Get user's orders
GET {{baseURL}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get order detail
GET {{baseURL}}/api/orders/ORDER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Health check
GET {{baseURL}}/health
